{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/the-wow-tower-mr-eight-development-dubailand-residence-complex","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1434,"crm_id":"7822","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"The Wow Tower","slug":"the-wow-tower-mr-eight-development-dubailand-residence-complex","display_address":"Dubailand Residence Complex","building_type":["apartment","offices"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Mr Eight Development","price":709000,"display_price":"709k","lattitude":25.090947212545,"longitude":55.37848469259,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The Wow Tower Dubai is a branded mixed-use high-rise by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-mr-eight-development/\">Mr Eight</a>, strategically positioned within the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubailand-residence-complex/\">Dubai Land Residence Complex (DLRC)</a> in Dubailand. Conceived as a defining vertical landmark, the tower is designed to stand out within a predominantly mid-rise district, giving it clear architectural prominence and skyline visibility.</p><p>The project integrates residential apartments and office units offering <strong>studios, one-bedroom, and two-bedroom layouts alongside commercial spaces</strong>. A rooftop swimming pool and an iconic padel court on the 43rd floor introduce distinctive lifestyle elements, adding to the project's appeal.&nbsp;</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_7d49aa0e03.jpg","hash":"Feature_7d49aa0e03","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_3f3087923e.jpg","hash":"Banner_3f3087923e","name":"Banner.jpg"},"media_images":[