e a visual and structural focal point within Dubai Land Residence Complex.</li><li>Mixed-Use Development - &nbsp;The integration of residential apartments and office units within one tower provides diversified ownership options in a single development.</li><li>Strategic Dubailand Positioning - Located within DLRC, a district connected to major road networks, including Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Emirates Road, supporting accessibility across Dubai.</li><li>Commercial Component - Dedicated office units within the tower introduce an additional asset class, supporting long-term leasing flexibility.</li><li>Signature 43rd-Floor Padel Court - The inclusion of a padel court positioned on the 43rd floor creates a distinct identity that differentiates the project from standard residential offerings.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":2111,"cta":{"id":2949,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Map_Location_7ad3c767a3.jpg","hash":"Map_Location_7ad3c767a3","name":"Map-Location.jpg"},"style":null,"title":"A Landmark Address in Dubailand","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>The Wow Tower location is set within Dubai Land Residence Complex (DLRC), a residential district inside the wider Dubailand master community. DLRC is positioned along key arterial routes, including Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Emirates Road, enabling direct connectivity to major business and lifestyle zones across Dubai.</p><ul><li>10 minutes to Dubai Silicon Oasis</li><li>10 minutes to Academic City</li><li>10 minutes to Dubai Outlet Mall</li><li>15 minutes to Global Village</li><li>15 minutes to IMG Worlds of Adventure</li><li>25 minutes to Dubai Mall</li><li>25 minutes to Business Bay</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{